---
import Layout from '../layouts/main.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import { withBase } from '../lib/utils';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | ZakTec Solutions" description="How the ZakTec Solutions website handles contact enquiries, hosting data, analytics and privacy requests.">
  <PageIntro eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy Policy" description="How we use information from website enquiries." />

  <section class="section-space">
    <div class="section-shell">
      <div class="content-page">
        <p><strong class="text-white">Last reviewed:</strong> 26 July 2026</p>
        <p>This page explains how this website currently handles personal information. It is general information, not legal advice.</p>

        <h2>Information you provide</h2>
        <p>If you submit the enquiry form, it may include your name, email address, optional phone number, subject and message. The form is processed by HAiBL on behalf of ZakTec Solutions.</p>

        <h2>How enquiries are used</h2>
        <p>We use this information to understand your request, reply to you and discuss possible work. We do not sell it or use it to train AI models.</p>

        <h2>Website hosting and technical data</h2>
        <p>GitHub Pages hosts this website. GitHub may process technical request data needed to deliver and protect the site. Its own privacy information explains this further.</p>

        <h2>Analytics and cookies</h2>
        <p>This website does not currently use analytics, advertising or preference cookies. See the <a href={withBase('/cookies')}>cookie information page</a> for details.</p>

        <h2>Retention</h2>
        <p>We keep email enquiries only as long as needed to reply, manage possible work and meet record-keeping duties.</p>
        <!-- TODO: Confirm and publish a specific business retention schedule before client operations scale. -->

        <h2>Your requests</h2>
        <p>You may ask what information we hold about your enquiry, request a correction or ask for deletion where applicable.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>For a privacy question or request, email <a href="mailto:hello@zaktecsolutions.com">hello@zaktecsolutions.com</a>.</p>

        <div class="mt-10 rounded-xl border border-amber-300/25 bg-amber-300/5 p-5 text-sm text-amber-100">
          Business identity details and the exact enquiry-retention schedule should be confirmed as part of a formal legal review before this policy is treated as final.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
